[09:59.88]position [pəˈzɪʃn]n. 位置，方位；职位；定位
[10:03.48]abundance [əˈbʌndəns]n. 大量；丰富；充裕 例 Such inferior products are available in abundance on the market. 搭 abundance of 许多 / abundance in... …丰富
[10:17.64]exodus [ˈeksədəs]n. 大批的离去 例 It's said that we're facing the exodus of foreign capital from real estate market.
[10:28.80]consign [kənˈsaɪn]vt. 托运；寄存；委托代销；把…交付 给；留出，拨出 例 We will consign the goods to our clients by express. 搭 consign sth. to sb. 把…交给某人
[10:41.88]apportion [əˈpɔːʃn]vt. 分配，分派；分摊 例 This helps to apportion the responsibility to the correct development team for detailed analysis.
[10:55.56]stumble [ˈstʌmbl]v. (使)踌躇；(使)绊倒；(使)困惑 n. 绊 倒；失足；错误 例 With rising labor costs, China's economic growth could stumble.
[11:07.68]referee [ˌrefəˈriː]n. 仲裁人；调解人；公证人；受委托人 v. 仲裁；当裁判
[11:12.96]facsimile [fækˈsɪməli]n. 传真；复制品；精摹 vt. 复制；摹 例 Along with the network popularisation, the digital facsimile has emerged due to the requirements of the times. 搭 facsimile machine 传真机 / in facsimile 一模 一样
